      "en": "The noise of the whip, the noise of the rattling of wheels, prancing horses, and bounding chariots,",
      "ko": "휙휙하는 채찍 소리, 굉굉하는 병거바퀴 소리, 뛰는 말, 달리는 병거,",
      "source_text_hash": "59281ab274d45bf13f1e35990b13499460ae9e876f278a97daba2c6ee2a95217",
      "translation_text_hash": "9cad5533c44a5c590b5201bf8e7d1312253fbc4ae5215defb7dce8cabeab0e48",
