      "en": "the horseman charging, and the flashing sword, the glittering spear, and a multitude of slain, and a great heap of corpses, and there is no end of the bodies. They stumble on their bodies",
      "ko": "충돌하는 기병, 번쩍이는 칼, 번개 같은 창, 살륙 당한 떼, 큰 무더기 주검, 무수한 시체여 사람이 그 시체에 걸려 넘어지니",
      "source_text_hash": "cd938d747e49ba8e93609b8134c6956a079d95b38898faf9fa103566d7abd8a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "d92c1b897c02319b8bed8ff79c9c4f3f60e8dadbb4215c61c4538afa71324706",
