        }
      ],
      "en": "Are you better than No-Amon, who was situated among the rivers, who had the waters around her, whose rampart was the sea, and her wall was of the sea?",
      "ko": "네가 어찌 노아몬보다 낫겠느냐 그는 강들 사이에 있으므로 물이 둘렸으니 바다가 성루가 되었고 바다가 성벽이 되었으며",
      "source_text_hash": "b3f933e8bb42bf1e78ea74c38952455883ca0915912baec57a98f8b2777064d3",
      "translation_text_hash": "bec22459a1fac56ac4b2d7b72046e6750560c67b4f0a07b6f1950ff6b0259ce0",
