      "en": "You also will be drunken. You will be hidden. You also will seek a stronghold because of the enemy.",
      "ko": "너도 취한바 되어 숨으리라 너도 대적을 인하여 피난처를 찾아보리라",
      "source_text_hash": "a6dd12e01f4896bc611b55f908838d7e18bf07c20ca6bacd45ffe1c7e81387df",
      "translation_text_hash": "67d16c97755bc7382a5195d74ce78aa29f167c17a8b4ff6c8fba633cccf22886",
