      "en": "All your fortresses will be like fig trees with the first-ripe figs. If they are shaken, they fall into the mouth of the eater.",
      "ko": "너의 모든 산성은 무화과나무의 처음 익은 열매가 흔들기만 하면 먹는 자의 입에 떨어짐과 같으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "5607bc9c23df560ae4aae51c7883080b65be44886a1eba7652b58a71ed2cb3b4",
      "translation_text_hash": "e633bcaa163053145977af10bc110b3fc572c06d0608d0dbc51c47d94d91c135",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
