      "en": "You have increased your merchants more than the stars of the skies. The grasshopper strips and flees away.",
      "ko": "네가 네 상고를 하늘의 별보다 많게 하였으나 황충이 날개를 펴서 날아감과 같고",
      "source_text_hash": "bde071906917ecf953c5bf16791b848b7b7ab9195909bc12e36ac22bb7a15dd8",
      "translation_text_hash": "96cdf490cdbc3b7cec58873bf90438708da90d394b5fbcdc659d11824b1212d0",
